window.products.push({"id":1086028,"name":"Disposable Paper Harvest Place Mats 50 Pack Hello Fall and Orange Pumpkins Table Mat Chargers for Halloween and Thanksgiving 11\" x 17\" Buffalo Plaid L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vcr5xhvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack of 50 disposable rectangle fall place mats. This pumpkin place mat is double sided and features 2 different designs on each side- one side is black and white checked background with orange pumpkin and green leaves, the other side has a beige background with a black border and has Hello Fall printed in the center with some maple leaves and a pumpkin. This carefully crafted table mats will dress up your table and add an elegant touch to any meal. Use under the trays and bowls of food as an extra holiday accent. Accent your fine china or dinnerware with a touch of fall-inspired style with the Thanksgiving paper place mat. Perfect for seafood restaurants, tropical resorts, birthday party, wedding receptions, fall banquets, rehearsal dinners, home, kitchen, hotel and business office. Plus, these disposable Halloween party place mats will make it easy to clean up after the event is over. When the party is over, simply toss or recycle. It's easy to bring autumn's beauty indoors for your fall wedding with these simply elegant place mats. Add a crisp, Halloween look and feel to any table setting with the farmhouse pumpkin table mat. Measures 11\" x 17\" the perfect size for your holiday needs! Enhance your home - Welcome in autumn leaves and pumpkin spice to your fall decorations with these place mats. Perfect decorations for your dining table or dresser during fall season! Festive under guest's dinner plates at the Thanksgiving feast. Easy way to add instant style and flair to your table top. Adds a finishing touch – Entertain guests and serve a big meal with all the fixings on our place mats year after year! Use these as place mats or hang them on walls as art! These mats are great classroom art projects as Halloween and Thanksgiving approaches. A fun autumn project for preschool students!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vcr5xhvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Boutique","source_asin":"B09Q98NKRK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q98NKRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q98NKRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1086029,"name":"Summer Sea by David Lloyd Glover, 35x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8143gKwJpkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features waves crashing on the shore. David Lloyd Glover has a 25 year internation reputation exhibiting in major galleries in the US, Canada, Mexico and Japan. His works have been acquired by collectors all over the world. Glover creates masterworks in watercolor on paper, gouache on paper, oil on canvas and acrylic on canvas with equal facility. After a career in the advertising industry he embarked on a full time vocation of creating fine art for gallery sales. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8143gKwJpkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLYCBIS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLYCBIS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLYCBIS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
