window.products.push({"id":1086169,"name":"THERMOS Vacuum insulated food container 0.5L Black JBM-500 BK","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":122.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EryVf3RfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 1904, Thermos has provided unique solutions for keeping food and beverages hot, cold and fresh. Today, Thermos is a global manufacturer of an expanding range of innovative portable food and beverage containers that provide a more comfortable, enjoyable eating and drinking experience for people on the go. Thermos delivers when it matters. Living Green matters. Thermos created the original reusable bottle, and we've been green for over 100 years. We are continuously developing products that provide people on-the-go with more sustainable choices. By selecting a reusable Thermos Brand product you can help reduce the amount of waste sent to landfills while enjoying the best performing products available.Technology matters. Our vacuumware uses Thermos's vacuum insulation technology to keep hot things hot and cold thing cold for hours. The vacuum insulation creates an airless space between two walls virtually eliminating temperature change. Soft coolers offer superior temperature retention performance with a quality multi-layered insulation structure consisting of a layer of dense, closed cell, polyethylene foam positioned between a rugged outer layer of textile and additional moisture repelled heat-sealed PEVA lining. Using more layers provides better insulation and better cold retention.Qualities matters. At Thermos, we carefully choose the best available materials, and produce products with consistent quality and reliable performance. We ensure the excellence of our products for quality throughout the entire manufacturing process, and we stand behind them 100%.Safety matters. You have the right to know how your products are made and what they're made of. We comply with all recognized safety standards, but we don't stop there. Thermos products are tested by independent labs to ensure that our material and processes are safe. Our products also meet current CPSIA standards so you can be confident you are giving your family the very safest products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EryVf3RfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THERMOS","source_asin":"B00M1ECX3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M1ECX3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M1ECX3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
