window.products.push({"id":1086369,"name":"Shower Caddy Basket Shelf, Bathroom Adhesive Shower Organizer Shelves with Drilling, 2 Pack Shower Storage with Multiple Hooks for Hanging Razor Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cABVMtvbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[PREMIUM MATERIAL, STURDY, RUSTPROOF] Adhesive shower caddy is made of high-quality SUS304 stainless steel with black baking finish, which is durable and waterproof. Smooth edges and curved, streamline design make it easier to pick up things without hurting you and your belongings. The strong weld seam and thickened wires make it load-bearing, keeping your shower essentials contained without bending. Hollow ventilated design at the shower shelves bottom makes it easy to drain and easy to clean. [LARGE CAPACITY, SPACE SAVER] Shower storage baskets have compact but spacious dual-space storage with built-in soap dish. It can maximize space and eliminate clutter, making your home neater and more beautiful. Shower organizers have various hooks for additional storage. Each shower caddy shelf has 3 hooks on each side to hang towels, bath balls, sponges, brushes, etc. Front hooks can be used to hang razor. In addition, we provide 3 extra detachable hooks that are not easily moved. [TWO INSTALLATIONS] Shower shelves are available in self-adhesive and drilling options to meet the needs of different wall surfaces. Shower caddy shelf are suitable for smooth, flat, dry surfaces such as glass, mirrors, tiles, fiberglass, and wood to avoid peeling. Please use a hair dryer to heat the adhesive and then remove it if you need to remove the sticker. For uneven or rough surfaces, such as wallpaper, painted walls, concrete or lime walls, you can wall mount shower shelf with screws. [MULTIPLE USES] shower shelf is versatile and suitable for any place with limited space, like bathroom, kitchen, travel trailer, dormitory, making the room neat and organized. You can store shower gel, soap, shampoo, shaving cream, curling iron in the bathroom. It is also ideal for storing sauces, spice, cooking oil in the kitchen. Hooks can hang cutting boards, spoons, towels, knives. Shower caddy shelf can be used for creams, lotions or any personal care products and cosmetics storage. [HUMANIZED SET, SATISFY ASSURED] Complete set comes with 1 large shower organizer, 1 small shower caddy shelf with built-in soap holder, 3 removable hooks, 4 adhesive pads, 8 nuts, 8 screws, 8 expansion anchors. Shower shelves are deep enough to prevent small items from falling. Waterproof adhesive with strong stickiness keeps shower storage basket stable and upright and can carry 33 lbs. If you are not satisfied with your purchase, just contact us, we will provide you a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cABVMtvbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topsome","source_asin":"B09MT1HVNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MT1HVNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MT1HVNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
