window.products.push({"id":1086713,"name":"National Standard Butane Fuel Canister – Smart Safer Self Sealing Nozzle Technology","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HzQTZDCBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Butane Fuel Canisters for Portable Camping Stoves   SELF SEALING NOZZLE - UL Listed - Butane Fuel Canisters feature a self-sealing nozzle. This stops the gas from leaking out when not inside a butane camping stove. You do not need to worry about gas leaks   FOR USE WITH BUTANE CAMPING STOVES – National Standard Butane Fuel Canisters are designed to be used with Butane Stoves. Please check your stove for Compatibility.   NOTCHED COLLAR FOR EASY ALIGNMENT - National Standard Butane Canisters have a notched collar which helps to align the canister inside the camping stove. This helps the user to easily align the canister.     MULTI COOKING SESSION CANISTERS - National Standard 8 oz. hold enough butane fuel to be able to last through multiple cooking sessions. Cooking time may vary depending on the model and brand of butane stove   National Standard Butane Fuel Canisters - when you purchase this product. Each 8 oz. butane canister will burn for approximately 2 hours at high heat and 4 hours at simmer to provide you with all of the cooking power you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HzQTZDCBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Standard","source_asin":"B09N2Z1LYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N2Z1LYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N2Z1LYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1086714,"name":"100L Large Capacity Clothes Storage Bag Organizer 3 Pack with Fiberglass Frame Oxford Fabric for Comforters, Blankets, Quilt, Bedding, Stackable Close","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612DhgS5p-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Material]: Our storage bags are made of moistureproof, breathable and wear-resistant 600D oxford fabric, which is more durable than ordinary materials such as non-woven fabric and can protect your stored items well on the basis of ensuring ventilation. The features of oxford fabric make the storage containers easier to clean, you just need to gently wipe it with a wet towel and air dry [Fiberglass Frame]: The closet organizer is equipped with a unique fiberglass frame, which is thicker and stronger than the common steel frame. The strong load-bearing capacity of glass fiber enables the storage organizer to be stacked for use. Different from the built-in steel frame, the frame of this foldable storage box is separable. This design allows the closet storage to be folded up when not in use. The removable frame also makes cleaning easier [Reinforced Handles & Zipper Closure]: There are sturdy handles on both sides of the blanket storage bags for easy movement. Due to tight and multiple stitches, the load-bearing capacity of the storage bag is doubled. The closet storage organizer is equipped with stainless steel zippers which are hard to break down. The design of two-way zippers makes the product more convenient to use [Clear Windows & Label Holder]: Each clothing storage containers has 2 see-through Windows on the front and side, which can view contents at a glance without opening. Thanks to the front and top zipper openings, you can easily remove items stored in the middle. The label holder on the side can record the contents of the container more effectively [Capacity & Size]: Each package contains 3 storage bins. Each storage container measures 23.62 x 16.54 x 15.75 in / 60 x 42 x 40 cm, with capacity 100L. The storage organizer is spacious to store your comforters, blankets, pillows, duvet, clothing, plush toys, clothes or other home items. Our clothing storage bags are not only suitable for closets and under the beds, but also for attics, basement, dormitories and so on","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612DhgS5p-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OS OMYSTYLE","source_asin":"B0B5X4NZ26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5X4NZ26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5X4NZ26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1086715,"name":"NURUMI - Press Plate - Principle of Fermentation Weight, Useful for Lots of Pickled Foods for Bucket Crock Batches Need Container Mouth Minimum Intern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g7sfunbtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pickled, matured, kimchi, fermented food, various extract making necessity What is a press plate? It is a press device made by scientifically approaching the principles pressed by using stones, plates, sticks, etc. to prevent going bad in the final process of enzymes, pickling, fermentation, and mature foods. Point 1.No more heavy objects are needed for pickled, matured, kimchi, fermented foods. Point 2.An eco-friendly PP material used in baby bottles.Sterilizing in boiling water. Point 3.Semi-permanent use on purchase once. Point 4.Circular, square, jar, any container available.Suitable for fermenting large quantities of food. Requirements. 1. Round Type : Minimum mouth (inlet) size - Diameter over 14cm (5.5in) at least - In this case, we recommend Jar 1.5 gallon or more because of mouth (opening) size. 2. Square Type: Minimum mouth (inlet) size - Over 18cm X 20cm (7.0in X 7.9in) at least How to use. 1. Fold the wings to fit the mouth and place them in a container.2. The folded wings unfold and fit the size of the container.3. Adjust the middle screwbar to control the height.4. Close the lid of the container with the screwbar pressed.5. Check that the foods are sink down then finish. Tips. If food is stored floating in water, it will go bad and etc. in contact with the air, so it is thoroughly prevented by using a pressing device.If you cut the food too small, it may float between the wings, so be careful. Problem solving. If the shape is deformed, boil it in boiling water and place flat objects such as ceramic plates on top of them. Then it will be shaped flat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g7sfunbtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NURUMI","source_asin":"B08DLKB4T7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DLKB4T7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DLKB4T7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
