window.products.push({"id":1086805,"name":"Natural Silk Pillowcase with Hyaluronic Acid for Hair and Skin with Hidden Zipper, 19mm 600 Thread Count, Both Sides Mulberry Silk Pillowcase by INNEL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Cjmii18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our new collection of silk pillowcases are the perfect complement to your beauty routine. Innelli Silk Pillowcase was designed with two different sides.We have integrated an Aqua side and a premium side. You will feel the difference and enjoy all benefits of the new Innelli Silk Pillowcase technology. Aqua side : The aqua side has been infused with a generous amount of Hyaluronic Acid which is critical in maintaining skin hydration. It locks in moisture and reduces lines and wrinkles. The aqua side is crafted from the highest grade of 19mm Mulberry silk infused with Hyaluronic Acid. Premium side : This side does not contain Hyaluronic acid. It is a 100% 19mm Premium Mulberry Silk, 6 A grade. This organic Mulberry silk has 18 essential amino acids and natural proteins. Studies have shown that amino acids can resist the effects of aging, calms the nervous system, the formation of creases near the eyes and it even reduces bed head. The smooth and soft texture of Innelli Pillowcase helps you feel cool and refreshing as you settle in for a good nights sleep. Dermatologically tested and hypoallergenic. Size: 20 x 30 in, Queen size with hidden zipper. Care Instructions: - Wash with a mild detergent or with a silk specific detergent. - Machine-washable in lukewarm water (30°C) on gentlestwashing cycle available. - Wash on the delicate spin cycle. - Hang dry is preferred. - Tumble dry on a cool setting if using drying machine. - Avoid drying for extended periods of time. - Iron when slightly damp using a cool setting. - Iron the pillowcase with the inside facing out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Cjmii18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N2","source_asin":"B085L2VL1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085L2VL1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085L2VL1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
