window.products.push({"id":1086860,"name":"Newbridge Rafiki Natural Tropical Monkey Print Indoor/Outdoor Fabric Napkins - Taupe Monkey Palm Tree Jungle Picnic, BBQ, and Patio Fabric Napkins, Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VqgtFFeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Rafiki Natural Tropical Monkey print indoor or outdoor fabric tablecloth by Newbridge was designed to be a favorite for your busy home, patio, kitchen or restaurant. The advanced 100% polyester tablecloth construction features a large scale Rafiki Natural Tropical Monkey and Palm Tree print with lively monkeys climbing on a large palm trees which are framed in an arabesque style trellis. The waterproof 100% polyester construction is great for outdoor use. The stain release and water repellant finish are color fast, the Rafiki Natural Tropical Monkey fabric tablecloth will add a new dimension to your outdoor or indoor dining. Also available in 2 zippered umbrella tablecloth sizes: 70 inch round zipper umbrella cloth and 60 in x 84 in oblong (rectangle) that have zippers that allow you to place around the umbrella on your patio table. Great for use with adults and children at home or in commercial settings. Perfect for decorating and keeping your table protected from everyday accidents. Finished with sewn edges. Easy to fold and store when not in use. Great for indoor, outdoor, home, and commercial use alike. The Rafiki Natural Tropical Monkey Print Indoor/Outdoor tablecloths are available in a large selection of sizes and shapes for all of your entertaining needs. Easy Care - Fade Resistant 100% polyester construction is machine washable and tumble dry and requires little or no ironing. Sizes available are: 52 x 52 Square, 52 x 70 Oblong, 60 x 84 Oblong, 60 x 84 Oval, 70 Round, 60 x 84 Oblong Zipper Umbrella Cloth and 70” Round Zipper Umbrella Cloth and Sets of 8 Fabric Napkins (set sold separately). Tropical natural and taupe palette for spring and summer patio, picnic, barbeque, kitchen, dining room entertaining. Great for Indoor and Outdoor Entertaining, Graduation Parties, Bridal and Baby Showers, Memorial Day, 4th of July, Labor Day, Indoor and Outdoor Entertaining, Barbeques, Kitchen, Dining, Parties, Picnics, Restaurants and Cafeterias","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VqgtFFeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newbridge","source_asin":"B07RH8697Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RH8697Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RH8697Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1086861,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice Prime Rated, NOVETE Retro Red Toaster with Wide Slots, 7 Bread Shade Settings & Removable Crumb Tray, High Lift Lever, Compact Stainle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dexoYgFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥪Efficient 2-Slice Toaster: Equipped with 1.5-inch extra-wide slots with an extended heating surface that allow you to toast various types of bread, including white bread, muffins, and artisanal bread; creates quick and evenly toasted bread every time, helping you prepare a warm, crispy, and nutritious breakfast, greatly saving time to ease up your morning routines 🥪BPA-Free Food Grade Stainless Steel Material: Made of non-toxic and BPA-free stainless steel, this NOVETE toaster is safe to use and ensures quick browning; the sleek and compact modern design makes it well-suited with any kitchen décor, and cleanup is a cinch with the easy-access crumb tray; in addition to an auto pop-up feature, the built-in high lift lever lets you raise the ready toast for safe removal without burning your fingers 🥪7 Adjustable Shade Settings: Choose from 7 levels of browning and crispiness, giving everyone in the family, from kids to adults, just what they want; suits individual preferences from light (levels 1-2), golden (levels 3-4), to deep dark toast (levels 5-7); multifunctional and easy to use, this NOVETE compact toaster delivers beautifully brown toast time and again, making an ideal gift for your family and friends 🥪3 Smart Functions for Quick Cooking Needs: The DEFROST function takes bread from frozen to toasted in one go for fresh-tasting results; the REHEAT button perfectly warms up forgotten toasted bread and brings crispiness back; simply press the CANCEL button to stop browning at any time to easily handle jammed bread and over-browning 🥪Worry-Free Use and Quality Assurance: ETL certified, our toaster gives you the ultimate in safety and reliability; NOVETE is committed to providing high-quality products and satisfactory services, and all our products are backed by a 100% quality assurance for 18 months; please feel free to contact us if you have any problems","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dexoYgFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVETE","source_asin":"B0822G28FL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0822G28FL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0822G28FL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
