window.products.push({"id":1086921,"name":"Tocirelo Christmas Stockings 4 Pack - 18 Inches White and Red Cable Knit Christmas Stocking, Large Farmhouse Stockings Christmas Decorations Gifts for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sPlnDy9QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎅CHRISTMAS STOCKINGS SET: The package comes with 2*white and 2*red knitted stockings for Christmas, they are in large size 18'' long with 6'' wide. These Christmas stockings are big enough to fill with toys and treats, which is the perfect hiding place for Santa's surprise gifts. The stockings with the loop can easily hang off the stair rail or fireplace as christmas decoration. Perfect addition to your Xmas theme this year. 🎄KNIT STOCKINGS FOR CHRISTMAS: These amply-sized stockings are made of super soft fabric and classic cable knitted patterns, nicely-made and reusable. They are very elastic and durable, will remain the shape even without liner. Warm and soft knitted Christmas stockings are perfect for cold winter nights, bring you a traditional yet sweet festive farmhouse holiday look at Christmas. 🎅GREAT CHRISTMAS PRESENT: Our christmas stockings are available in 2 colors, ivory white and Christmas red, which matchs the Christmas atmosphere very well. You can also add some festive pom-poms, glittery sequins, rhinestone pins and tassels or sew different letters to create personalized Christmas stockings for your famliy and friends during the holiday season. 🎄WIDELY USE: Pretty hanging stockings are a Christmas classic! Hang these Christmas stockings from your mantel, staircase, door, wall or christmas tree, the cream-colored stockings bring a minimal yet cozy look, the burgundy knit stockings will envelop your mantel in warmth—no matter where, these Christmas stockings work for every space and style. 🎅QUALITY SERVICE: Tocirelo always guarantees to provide customers with high quality product and best service. We would offer our customers a full refund or replacement if you were not satisfied with our Christmas stockings in any aspect. Any questions, do not hesitate to contact us. Christmas is coming soon, you can’t wait it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sPlnDy9QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tocirelo","source_asin":"B0BKPRWCHX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKPRWCHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKPRWCHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1086922,"name":"Christmas Wreath for Front Door - DECSPAS 24 Inch 2 FT Prelit Snowy Flocked Christmas Wreaths with Timer 30 LED Lights Red Berries Pine Cones, Xmas Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ior5NQEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️Snowy Christmas Decorations - The flocked Christmas wreath with 30 LED warm lights is an essential Christmas decor for celebrating Christmas. Decorate you home with these 24 inch Christmas wreaths that has lifelike Red Berries and Pine Cones, and this is a perfect addition to enliven the dreamlike atmosphere of Christmas. This sophisticated flocked indoor outdoor Christmas wreath with lights creates a happy, humble welcome. ❄️Energy Saving - DECSPAS Christmas wreath with lights is 3 AA batteries (NOT INCLUDED) powered. It also features a timer mode (6 hours on, 18 hours off) for automatic on/off convenience. Push the switch(Off/Timer/On) to the middle to activate TIMER. Just need to turn the timer on one time, it lights up in the pre-programmed timing sequence of 6 hours on and 18 hours off every day. The large Christmas wreaths can be used for the whole Christmas without replacing batteries. ❄️Superior Materials - Our Christmas wreaths for front door use premium artificial PVC branches and is flocked with snow, just as vivid as it just came out of the forest. Equipped with sturdy branches, strong enough to hold Bow ribbons and all your favorite ornaments for a customized look. A must-have for your Christmas decorations for year-round use. ❄️Light Up Your Christmas Space - Inspire and accompany you through the whole Christmas, this eye-catching flocked Christmas wreath greatly enhances the atmosphere of Christmas and holiday. This Christmas wreath can be used to decorate your front door, windows, fireplaces, wall and gate. Also used as a perfect Christmas gift for family, friends and neighbors for housewarming, wedding, Christmas. ❄️100% Satisfaction Customer Service - If you have any question, please feel free to contact us, we provide 90 days warranty and 24/7 online support customer service. If, for any reason, you are not 100% satisfied with our products, we will issue you a full refund or a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ior5NQEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECSPAS","source_asin":"B0BG6SDVDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG6SDVDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG6SDVDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
