window.products.push({"id":1086932,"name":"Glass Food Storage Containers Set, 62 Pack Storage Containers with Lids & BPA-free Disposable Plastic Portion Cups, Leak Proof Glass Meal Prep Contain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MkSgzIdXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【134-PIECE GLASS FOOD STORAGE CONTAINER SET】Package includes 24pcs glass containers with lids: 4 *(35.2 oz/1040ml), 4 *(23 oz/680ml), 4*(13.87oz/410ml); Pack of 50 durable portion cups with 50 lids 1.5 ounce (45ml) capacity and 10 pcs stainless steel cake fruit forks. These Glass food storage containers with various sizes and shapes to meet your everyday food storage needs, perfect for prep meals at home and bring it to work, school or the gym, travel and more. 【HIGH QUALITY GLASS & BPA FREE】:Our kitchen storage containers are made of premium borosilicate transparent glass, containers tolerate rapid temperature changes, never warping or cracking. Glass Storage Containers are BPA Free, hot foods can be transferred directly to the containers, as no chemicals will leech into the food. Lids are crafted of BPA-free plastic, making them a safe choice. 【OVEN, MICROWAVE(Not the lids), DISHWASHER/FREEZER SAFE】These storage containers can withstand temperatures from -40℃/-40℉ in freezer to 400℃/752℉ in oven, you can use them in oven, microwave (not the lids), freezer storage and dishwasher. Okay to wash the lids in the dishwasher, but high temperatures over a long period of time can deform the silicone sealing strip at the edge of the lid. Please wash the lids by hand as much as possible. 【AIRTIGHT SEAL LEAK PROOF】 Newly innovated hinged-lids technology enables the lid to creates an airtight seal for food freshness, never food spilling over again. These glass containers will be a good helper for serving your daily food storage needs,not only are these good for dry foods but also great for holding liquids such as juice, soup and more. 【50PACKS PORTION CUPS & 10 STEEL FORKS】Also come with 10PCS Stainless steel fruits forks, 50packs plastic jello shot cups, condiment cups, portion cups with lids, airtight lids with audible snap closure to ensure secure lid seal and no leaks at all. They made of durable crack-resistant polypropylene. If you find any damaged or defective product after receiving it or during daily use,please feel free to contact our customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MkSgzIdXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUNLIN","source_asin":"B093FDZCVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1086932","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093FDZCVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093FDZCVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
